OL,3,GNEWSATube drivers strike over shift
OL,4,Achange plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FTube drivers have walked out in the
OL,7,Ffirst of eight planned strikes, causing
OL,8,Fdisruption across the London
OL,9,FUnderground.
OL,11,FMembers of the RMT union walked out at
OL,12,Fmidday on Thursday in a dispute over
OL,13,Fproposed changes to working patterns
OL,14,Fand are due to remain on strike until
OL,15,F11:59 GMT on Friday.
OL,17,FThe Circle line had no service
OL,18,Fthroughout Thursday, while services on
OL,19,Fother lines began to reduce from 10:00.
OL,20,FNo Tube trains are expected to run on
OL,21,Fthe network after 21:00.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
