OL,3,GNEWSATube drivers strike over shift
OL,4,Achange plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FServices are expected to resume from
OL,7,Fabout 07:00 on Friday, although the
OL,8,FCircle, Piccadilly and Waterloo & City
OL,9,Flines will not run until midday. TfL
OL,10,Fexpects a normal service to return from
OL,11,Fabout 18:00, ahead of further planned
OL,12,Fstrikes.
